    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89604" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόσ-κλησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσκαλέω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>judicial summons</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				1041
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				846c
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				855d
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				D.
				43.16
			</span></i>: generally, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τοῦ δίσκου
			π</span>. <i>summons</i> to quoit-throwing, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>2 Ma.</u>
				4.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>invocation</i>, 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κλισις</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				1.12
			</span></i>.</div>
